  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/1502",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>디지털센서를 활용하여 중력가속도 상수 측정 실험하기</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">전기 스위치 센서 2개(이지메이커에서는 DIY-B 센서)를 이용하여</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">질량이 다른 추의 중력가속도를 구해보았습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>실험 재료(준비물)</b></span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">10g 추(금속 와샤), 20g 추(금속 와샤)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">낙하물체 가이드용 실(일반 실)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">스탠드1개 &amp; 클램프 2개</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">클립 4개</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">스카치 테이프,</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">상단부와 하단부에 클립을 고정할 종이 상자 또는 플라스틱으로 된 판</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가위, 줄자(50cm 측정용)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이지메이커 보드</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">DIY-B 센서 2개</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">센서 연결 케이블 2개</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">USB 케이블 (보드와 노트북 연결용)</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">노트북 또는 태블릿</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아래 그림처럼 스탠드, 클램프, 실, 테이프를 통해 실험 장치를 세팅합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29687ed810f7def2c183762a9cfae6faa30508d4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"454\" height=\"935\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/29687ed810f7def2c183762a9cfae6faa30508d4\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"2966\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">상단(출발부)와 하단(도착부)의 높이를 0.5m 로 맞추어 제작합니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d6b31258805eab1d24558ebf6bcb2329a109a0e8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d6b31258805eab1d24558ebf6bcb2329a109a0e8\" data-origin-width=\"448\" data-origin-height=\"473\"><div class=\"figcaption\">상단부(도착부)의 아랫면에 클립 2개를 붙입니다.</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d64e34575c9f69e52b8205a64862d1c5a3c4538\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d64e34575c9f69e52b8205a64862d1c5a3c4538\" data-origin-width=\"422\" data-origin-height=\"634\"><div class=\"figcaption\">하단부(도착부)의 윗면에 클립 2개를 붙입니다.</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">클립 각각에 DIY-B센서를 연결합니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아래와 같이 간단하게(?) 블록 코딩하여 실험하여도 되지만,</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b40adb87bfc9fb7cc7061158c0a18f177bcc05af\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b40adb87bfc9fb7cc7061158c0a18f177bcc05af\" data-origin-width=\"1254\" data-origin-height=\"856\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">바로 중력가속도 상수가 데이터로 나오게 계산식을 넣은 코드를 넣어 실험해봅니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a55a826d3ca6ee815df42114c1cfd642a9e3572\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a55a826d3ca6ee815df42114c1cfd642a9e3572\" data-origin-width=\"679\" data-origin-height=\"666\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">10g 추, 20g 추 각 10회씩의 데이터 입니다.&#160;</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>10g 추 실험</b></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>20g 추 실험</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>회수</b></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>시간</b></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>g값</b></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>시간</b></span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>g값</b></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">0.32</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">9.47</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">0.32</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">9.89</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">0.30</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">10.96</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">0.32</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">9.64</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">0.35</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">8.31</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">0.34</span></td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">8.91</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4</span><